# Copy to .env.development and fill in. It is not committed, and it must
# never be: the token below is a full login to your Home Assistant.
#
# A long-lived access token, used only by `npm run dev` (which runs outside
# Home Assistant and so has no session to borrow), `npm run sync` and
# `npm run deploy`. The built dashboard never contains it: inside Home
# Assistant it uses the connection the page already has.
# https://developers.home-assistant.io/docs/auth_api/#long-lived-access-token
VITE_HA_TOKEN=
